    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1131_SD05R0114_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Mars: There’s no need to rush.\r",
        "I can understand you want to battle\n",
        "our boss real bad, but you’ll have\\fto go through me first.\r",
        "After all, you’ve made me look bad\n",
        "more times than I care to remember!\r"
      ]
    },
