      "en_US": [
        "Jupiter: And I’ll be next.\r",
        "You might be tough, but this time,\n",
        "the gloves are coming off!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1131_SD05R0114_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hold on one second!\r",
        "Don’t you start the party without\n",
        "me!\r"
