      "en_US": [
        "Jupiter: Humph!\r",
        "Well, if it isn’t the little boy who\n",
        "ran off crying at Lake Acuity!\r",
        "Did you get any tougher since then?\n",
        "We’ll beat you two-on-two!\r"
